abstract: "A finite algebra over epistemic states, implemented as a reproducible visual notation system with enforced invariants. Four-state classification (NORMATIVE / NON-NORMATIVE / CRITICAL / METACOGNITIVE) realised as the Klein four-group V4, encoded redundantly through color, orientation, and textual label. v2.0.1 is a corrective patch release on top of v2.0.0: it fixes a story-table overflow in OWL-SEMAPHORE-EXPLANATION.pdf and updates version stamps. The V4 algebra, the sigma_h assignment to METACOGNITIVE, the canonical formal sentence, and the accessibility rule are unchanged from v2.0.0."
keywords:
  - visual epistemic notation
  - classification system
  - Klein four-group
  - V4
  - DNS Tool
  - documentation
  - epistemology
  - metacognition
  - accessibility
